   "title": "Opposition accuses Delhi government of manipulating air pollution data; BJP alleges conspiracy behind Punjab farm fires",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/cities/Delhi/opposition-accuses-delhi-government-of-manipulating-air-pollution-data-bjp-alleges-conspiracy-behind-punjab-farm-fires/article71683818.ece",
   "domain": "thehindu.com",
