   "summary_zh": "第40天回顾：参议院弹劾法庭将于11月9日星期一继续审理副总统萨拉·杜特尔特的弹劾案，辩方将开始就剩余的第二条指控——来源不明的财富——陈述案情。迈克尔·波亚表示，无意推迟对副总统萨拉·杜特尔特的弹劾审理。迈克尔·波亚表示，他们已准备好在副总统萨拉·杜特尔特弹劾案中提交首批证物。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "DAY 40 LOOK: The Senate impeachment court resumes the trial of Vice President Sara Duterte on Monday, November 9, with the defense set to begin presenting its case on the remaining Article II on unexplained wealth. #VPonTrial | @AprBenjaminINQ Follow our live updates here: https://t.co/SWECgeCeFE Watch our livestream here: https://t.co/po7XAvH5Tj WATCH: With 30 trial days allotted for the defense, Atty. Michael Poa said it does not intend to delay the impeachment trial of VP Sara Duterte. #VPonTrial | @keithcINQ Follow our live updates here: https://t.co/ckA4Jo4Ibs Watch our livestream here: https://t.co/kwc0l7XgC3 https://t.co/mOSw4nR8kS WATCH: Defense counsel and spokesperson Atty. Michael Poa said they are ready to present their first exhibits for VP Sara Duterte’s impeachment trial. #VPonTrial | @keithcINQ Follow our live updates here: https://t.co/SWECgeCeFE Watch our livestream here: https://t.co/po7XAvH5Tj WATCH: Prosecution spokesperson Cong. Zia Alonto Adiong says he believes the defense team may have difficulties in counter-arguing “facts that have already been established” relating to their allegations that VP Sara Duterte amassed unexplained wealth. #VPonTrial | @bellepechayINQ Follow our live updates here: https://t.co/SWECgeCeFE Watch our livestream here: https://t.co/po7XAvH5Tj WATCH: House lead prosecutor Gerville Luistro maintains that the sole witness who can explain the allegations against her best is the respondent, Vice President Sara Duterte herself. #VPonTrial | @bellepechayINQ Follow our live updates here: https://t.co/SWECgeCeFE Watch our livestream here: https://t.co/po7XAvH5Tj",
