   "title": "Is your petrol really E20? Karnataka claims ethanol levels reached 31%",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/videos/is-your-petrol-really-e20-karnataka-claims-ethanol-levels-reached-31/article71677871.ece",
   "domain": "thehindu.com",
   "source": "thehindu.com",
   "published": "Sat, 07 Nov 2026 15:03:32 +0530",
   "_dt": 1794044012.0,
